A work case for a learner who works in research: reading values off plots of detector measurements (points, a curve, axis ticks, a truncated axis). The app shows a panel's metrics as short lines of text, never a drawn plot, so every value a decision asks the learner to read comes as metrics: the plotted points, the curve's readings and the axis ranges and intervals, each a short label and value. No metric value or label is a chart, table or picture drawn in text, no note tells anyone how to draw or display something, and no decision asks for a value the panels, messages and replies never give. General to the field, with no real lab.